Under the Berne Convention (181 member countries), copyright protection is automatic upon creation. No registration is required. However, registration with the China Copyright Protection Center (中国版权保护中心) is recommended as additional evidence of ownership.

伯尔尼公约（181个成员国）：版权自创作完成时自动获得，无需登记。但建议在中国版权保护中心做著作权登记，作为权属的补充证据。
